    "explanation": "Whitemane excels in short team fights and at contesting Objectives that take less than 30 seconds to be secured (for example Infernal Shrines). If the fight takes too long, she struggles to keep up with her Mana consumption.\n\nThe least interesting Maps to play Whitemane on are the ones where she cannot abuse her kit around the Objective, that are heavily focused on Mercenaries (such as Sky Temple), or where the early game is too important (notably Braxis Holdout)."
